{"v":2,"catch":"透過牌組構築，打造出最強大的咒術。","desc":"這是一款牌組構築的 Roguelike 遊戲。透過對 100 多種精心設計的咒術進行構築與融合，最終打造出最強大的咒術。\n\n50 多種獨特的敵人組成各式各樣的關卡。你需要選擇專屬的戰鬥策略，並在恰到好處的時機施放強力咒語，才能擊退源源不絕的敵人！\n\n遭遇不同的事件，選擇危險或安全的路線，面對不同的敵人，挑選不同的卡牌，發現各種神祕聖物！","publisher":"Happy Player","release":"2026-03-26","genres":["模擬"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","中文 (簡體字)","中文 (繁體字)"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"size":"Switch 2 0.6GB / Switch 0.6GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/87f092e6476dbf32338c5f4854bc111cf87d0e1b696b68bdcd7bb4a9a267eb63.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9b73a4da2b5ace3815f57ce5778e32681eae5d11976dcea7e5860ff0bcb242d4.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/fbd0c03f95e67e3a36805c3440632a4a3e4b0115e15f308fea9cb24ef54e5d20.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/dab3c3eb81cf3f47c1dd00284734d5ec5d8710d60603240160801d64fefba7f5.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/044e75bb7c2bf166553729f503ff2f6631178687311be22ca7bfbeec3272c7f4.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c1cb5227c176c2ec079dde2320b1cb5a64d75e5dc3a01134807d0160673207f1.jpg"],"dlc":[{"id":"70050000070367","name":"魔法狂潮","img":"9638c40c36a7de909a58506287da75d52ecec0dc07df4bec388401005cf84268","date":"2026-03-26","mem":false}],"dlcTotal":1,"titleId":"01007df024d42000"}